{
  "id": 107690064,
  "iid": 3603,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "CMake: Remove a duplicate target include directory.",
  "description": "epan/CMakeLists.txt set both SYSTEM PUBLIC and SYSTEM PRIVATE for\nGLIB2_INCLUDE_DIRS. The PUBLIC keyword adds it to the\nINTERFACE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES property, which is only appropriate for\nincludes that we ship with Wireshark, so remove that one. Make\nGLIB2_LIBRARIES private as well.\n\nFixes #17477.",
  "state": "merged",
