        },
        {
          "id": 651388883,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "What happens if you add\n\n```\ntarget_include_directories(epan SYSTEM PRIVATE ${GLIB2_INCLUDE_DIRS})\n```\n\nto your plugin's CMakeLists.txt? As mentioned in [issue 17477](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/issues/17477#note_622923561), public include directories with absolute paths can cause CMake errors.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1789948913",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs"
