        },
        {
          "id": 651400191,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "```\nCMake Error at CMakeLists.txt:28 (target_include_directories):\n  target_include_directories may only set INTERFACE properties on IMPORTED\n  targets\n-- Configuring incomplete, errors occurred!\nSee also \"/home/nicolas/src/wireshark/doc/plugins.example/build/CMakeFiles/CMakeOutput.log\".\n```",
